@{
    Layout = "_AdminLayout";
    ViewData["Title"] = "DR Runbook";
}

<div class="container-fluid py-3" style="max-width:720px">
    <h1 class="h3">Disaster recovery runbook</h1>
    <ol class="small">
        <li>Create a fresh backup from <strong>Enterprise → Backup</strong> before any change.</li>
        <li>Copy <code>App_Data/backups/*.zip</code> off-box (object storage / encrypted disk).</li>
        <li>To restore: use <em>Stage restore</em>, stop the app, replace <code>blog.db</code> with the staged file, start the app.</li>
        <li>Verify <code>/ready</code> returns <code>ready</code> and smoke-test login + home + a post.</li>
        <li>If legal hold is active, do not purge users/posts until holds are released.</li>
        <li>Re-run schema bootstrap is automatic on start via <code>SchemaBootstrap.EnsureAsync</code>.</li>
        <li>Document RPO/RTO with your hosting provider; scheduled backups can call the same service from a cron job hitting an authenticated admin endpoint.</li>
    </ol>
    <a asp-action="Index">← Back to Enterprise</a>
</div>
